Kubernetes Architecture
Architecture divided into two parts: Master Node (Control Plane) and Worker Node. 4
Master Node Components:
API Server — handles all requests and communication. 5
ETCD — stores the cluster state in key-value pairs (not a database, but a memory/state store). 67
Scheduler — finds the best node to place a pod. 8
Controller Manager — manages cluster resources and performs activities. 910
Worker Node Components:
Kubelet — agent that passes information between worker and master nodes. 11
Kube Proxy — handles networking/internet access; works as a Service. 1213
Container Runtime (Docker) — runs containers/applications. 1415
